            <ArticleTitle>Transcriptional control of insulin-sensitive glucose carrier Glut4 expression in adipose tissue cells.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>145-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1134/S1607672916020186</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In search for new targets for obesity treatment, we have studied the effect of several transcription factors on the conversion of murine preadipocytes from the 3T3-L1 cell line into adipocytes. We have found that knockdown of Prep1 gene expression affects adipogenic differentiation and results in significant increase in the insulin-sensitive glucose carrier Glut4 gene expression.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
